<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 73.1547 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 73.1547 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge rose to 73.1547 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Tuesday from 73.2312 on Monday.</p>
<p>				    Dec 24		  Dec 23</p>
<p>    tenge per dollar	  73.1547		 73.2312</p>
<p>    volume($ million)		6.785		   5.550</p>
<p>    tenge per mark	    47.1819		 47.2600</p>
<p>    volume (DM million)	    0.080		   0.245</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
